<title>USA: Swisher signs cleaning deal with Exxon.</title>
<headline>Swisher signs cleaning deal with Exxon.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swisher International Inc said Monday it will provide restroom hygiene services to locations owned by Exxon Corp's Exxon Petroleum in a deal that could mean $25 million in sales for the company.</p>
<p>Swisher, a franchisor of commercial hygiene services and products, did not say how the three-year deal might affect its earnings.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Swisher reported revenues of $3.1 million for the second quarter ended April 30.</p>
